{"id":"n24929-1-7","stage":2,"title":"처녀 · 姑娘","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24929-1-7-1","ko":"아버지, 어머니 젊었을 때 모습은 어땠어요?","zh":"爸爸，妈妈年轻时的样子是怎样的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아버지,","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어머니","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"2","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"젊었을","meaning":"年青，年轻","explanation":"젊다：年青，年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모습은","meaning":"样子，景象，状况","explanation":"모습：样子，景象，状况；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"모습","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62383","senseId":"2","lemma":"모습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"408a4bd77b296caa","term":"젊다","zh":"年青，年轻","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3","entryId":"75773","definition":"正值壮年。","pronunciation":["점ː따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"4b8858fa4bec51bc","term":"모습","zh":"样子，景象，状况","audio":"/audio/4b8858fa4bec51bc3aa6.mp3","entryId":"62383","definition":"表露于外的状态或形貌。","pronunciation":["모습"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6fe5ca0888f32ad46b95.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24929-1-7-2","ko":"너희 엄마 처녀 시절엔 정말 예뻤지.","zh":"你们妈妈的少女时代可真是漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처녀","meaning":"姑娘，闺女","explanation":"처녀：姑娘，闺女","readings":[{"term":"처녀","audio":"/audio/9efbc39a6a1e7ff89f8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24929","senseId":"1","lemma":"처녀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시절엔","meaning":"时期","explanation":"시절：时期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"1","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예뻤지.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"9efbc39a6a1e7ff8","term":"처녀","zh":"姑娘，闺女","audio":"/audio/9efbc39a6a1e7ff89f8a.mp3","entryId":"24929","definition":"尚未结婚的成年女子。","pronunciation":["처ː녀"]},{"id":"4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8","term":"시절","zh":"时期","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3","entryId":"65302","definition":"特定的时期或时间。","pronunciation":["시절"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/001a27145ba3186d1297.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.277,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24929","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":73,"sequenceScore":2.0023,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你们妈妈的少女时代可真是漂亮啊。","两位看起来关系非常好呢。","爸爸，妈妈年轻时的样子是怎样的呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你们妈妈的少女时代可真是漂亮啊。","爸爸，妈妈年轻时的样子是怎样的呢？","两位看起来关系非常好呢。"],"answer":0}]}
